ing forward to seeing during all of  this death and destruction and fire and  blood among house targaryen we also get  our first full glimpse of house  velaryon's incredible strength as well  we finally see some of lord corliss  velaryon's massive fleet most likely  while him and daemon are often the  stepstone starting a kingdom of their  own now i'm assuming most of the battle  scenes and fire breathing dragon scenes  you see will come from these battles  when daemon and lord corliss lead an  army of adventurers and the second sons  we actually get many great shots of  daemon and his dragon karaxis during  this battle alone in fact my favorite  shot from this video is when daemon's  dragon karaxis unleashes a waterfall of  hell on this man standing down below not  only does this look amazing but like i  said earlier it also looks horrifying  imagining what this must feel like i  know i would not want to be on the other  side staring down the barrel of one of  these massive dragons while daemon and  lorcorlus velaryon are off gallivanting  around the seven kingdoms rhaenara and  alison's relationship continues to  dissolve in king's landing i love how  this new video shows rhaenyra and alison  giving each other dirty looks while we  hear someone say the road ahead is  uncertain once again this foreshadows  alison and rhaenyra's fallout and  inevitable fight over who holds the keys  to the kingdom once viserys targaryen is  gone although this new teaser trailer is  only 50 seconds long it does a great job  at setting up this season's biggest  moments and conflicts i actually think  this might be my favorite one out of all  the videos hbo has released so far in  only a few days from now a new era of  game of thrones will begin thanks to  house of the dragon we will all be back  together again when we dive headfirst  into george rr martin's amazing a song  of ice and fire universe  now i don't know about all of you but i  know i've surely missed westeros as  being one